{"id":"769638b12e2bdfd0","group":"14","path":"14/14-thm-representable-tensor.md","title":"Theorem — Representable Tensor Identity","display":"Theorem — Representable Tensor Identity","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-thm-representable-tensor","aliases":["14-thm-representable-tensor"],"display":"Theorem — Representable Tensor Identity","depends_on":["[[14-df-set-functor-tensor]]","[[14-thm-tensor-hom-adjunction]]","[[14-df-yoneda-embedding]]","[[14-df-natural-transformation]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","source_locator":"VII.5，公式 (2)、(4)–(6)，印刷页 379–380；VII.2，Hom–tensor adjunction；DjVu 第 195–196 图页"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-thm-representable-tensor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-thm-representable-tensor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Theorem — Representable Tensor Identity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"decc9a8183e886fb\" href=\"?note=decc9a8183e886fb\" title=\"14-df-set-functor-tensor\">14-df-set-functor-tensor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9be0fca5551bd9d2\" href=\"?note=9be0fca5551bd9d2\" title=\"14-thm-tensor-hom-adjunction\">14-thm-tensor-hom-adjunction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"99b72d10a7d872f5\" href=\"?note=99b72d10a7d872f5\" title=\"14-df-yoneda-embedding\">14-df-yoneda-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1bdaf4a293143165\" href=\"?note=1bdaf4a293143165\" title=\"14-df-natural-transformation\">14-df-natural-transformation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"VII.5，公式 (2)、(4)–(6)，印刷页 379–380；VII.2，Hom–tensor adjunction；DjVu 第 195–196 图页"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 为小范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\">\\(A:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}\\)</span> 是协变函子；张量函子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_A\">\\(T_A\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"decc9a8183e886fb\" href=\"?note=decc9a8183e886fb\" title=\"14-df-set-functor-tensor\">14-df-set-functor-tensor</a>，其 Hom 伴随见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9be0fca5551bd9d2\" href=\"?note=9be0fca5551bd9d2\" title=\"14-thm-tensor-hom-adjunction\">14-thm-tensor-hom-adjunction</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 为 Yoneda 嵌入，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,D\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(C,D\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:D\\to C\">\\(u:D\\to C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in A(D)\">\\(b\\in A(D)\\)</span>。集合范畴箭头作用按有类型缩写解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\epsilon_C\\coloneqq\\bigl(y(C)\\otimes_{\\mathcal C}A,A(C),([(D,u,b)]\\mapsto A(u)(b))\\bigr),\\\\\n\\epsilon_C^{-1}\\coloneqq\\bigl(A(C),y(C)\\otimes_{\\mathcal C}A,(a\\mapsto[(C,1_C,a)])\\bigr),\\\\\n\\epsilon_C\\circ\\epsilon_C^{-1}=1_{A(C)},\\qquad\n\\epsilon_C^{-1}\\circ\\epsilon_C=1_{y(C)\\otimes_{\\mathcal C}A}.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\epsilon_C\\coloneqq\\bigl(y(C)\\otimes_{\\mathcal C}A,A(C),([(D,u,b)]\\mapsto A(u)(b))\\bigr),\\\\\n\\epsilon_C^{-1}\\coloneqq\\bigl(A(C),y(C)\\otimes_{\\mathcal C}A,(a\\mapsto[(C,1_C,a)])\\bigr),\\\\\n\\epsilon_C\\circ\\epsilon_C^{-1}=1_{A(C)},\\qquad\n\\epsilon_C^{-1}\\circ\\epsilon_C=1_{y(C)\\otimes_{\\mathcal C}A}.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：VII.5，公式 (4)–(6)，印刷页 379–380；DjVu 第 195–196 图页。</p>\n<p>求值保持张量生成关系，因为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(u\\circ v)(a)=A(u)(A(v)(a))\">\\(A(u\\circ v)(a)=A(u)(A(v)(a))\\)</span>。其逆的两次复合由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[D,u,b]=[C,1_C,A(u)(b)]\">\\([D,u,b]=[C,1_C,A(u)(b)]\\)</span> 和恒等律得到；这两个箭头对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 自然，给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_A\\circ y\">\\(T_A\\circ y\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的自然同构。本条专门记录可表张量同构，商构造与 Hom 伴随复用<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"decc9a8183e886fb\" href=\"?note=decc9a8183e886fb\" title=\"14-df-set-functor-tensor\">14-df-set-functor-tensor</a>/<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9be0fca5551bd9d2\" href=\"?note=9be0fca5551bd9d2\" title=\"14-thm-tensor-hom-adjunction\">14-thm-tensor-hom-adjunction</a>，不重复定义。未作机器验证。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-set-functor-tensor","status":"resolved","id":"decc9a8183e886fb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-set-functor-tensor]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-tensor-hom-adjunction","status":"resolved","id":"9be0fca5551bd9d2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-tensor-hom-adjunction]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-yoneda-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"99b72d10a7d872f5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-yoneda-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-natural-transformation","status":"resolved","id":"1bdaf4a293143165","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-natural-transformation]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-set-functor-tensor","status":"resolved","id":"decc9a8183e886fb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 为小范畴，$A:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 是协变函子；张量函子 $T_A$ 见 [[14-df-set-functor-tensor]]，其 Hom 伴随见 [[14-thm-tensor-hom-adjunction]]。$y$ 为 Yoneda 嵌入，$C,D\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)$，$u:D\\to C$、$b\\in A(D)$。集合范畴箭头作用按有类型缩写解释。","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-tensor-hom-adjunction","status":"resolved","id":"9be0fca5551bd9d2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 为小范畴，$A:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$ 是协变函子；张量函子 $T_A$ 见 [[14-df-set-functor-tensor]]，其 Hom 伴随见 [[14-thm-tensor-hom-adjunction]]。$y$ 为 Yoneda 嵌入，$C,D\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)$，$u:D\\to C$、$b\\in A(D)$。集合范畴箭头作用按有类型缩写解释。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-set-functor-tensor","status":"resolved","id":"decc9a8183e886fb","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"求值保持张量生成关系，因为 $A(u\\circ v)(a)=A(u)(A(v)(a))$。其逆的两次复合由 $[D,u,b]=[C,1_C,A(u)(b)]$ 和恒等律得到；这两个箭头对 $C$ 自然，给 $T_A\\circ y$ 与 $A$ 的自然同构。本条专门记录可表张量同构，商构造与 Hom 伴随复用[[14-df-set-functor-tensor]]/[[14-thm-tensor-hom-adjunction]]，不重复定义。未作机器验证。","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-tensor-hom-adjunction","status":"resolved","id":"9be0fca5551bd9d2","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"求值保持张量生成关系，因为 $A(u\\circ v)(a)=A(u)(A(v)(a))$。其逆的两次复合由 $[D,u,b]=[C,1_C,A(u)(b)]$ 和恒等律得到；这两个箭头对 $C$ 自然，给 $T_A\\circ y$ 与 $A$ 的自然同构。本条专门记录可表张量同构，商构造与 Hom 伴随复用[[14-df-set-functor-tensor]]/[[14-thm-tensor-hom-adjunction]]，不重复定义。未作机器验证。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"A:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}","display":false},{"tex":"T_A","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"C,D\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"u:D\\to C","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in A(D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\epsilon_C\\coloneqq\\bigl(y(C)\\otimes_{\\mathcal C}A,A(C),([(D,u,b)]\\mapsto A(u)(b))\\bigr),\\\\\n\\epsilon_C^{-1}\\coloneqq\\bigl(A(C),y(C)\\otimes_{\\mathcal C}A,(a\\mapsto[(C,1_C,a)])\\bigr),\\\\\n\\epsilon_C\\circ\\epsilon_C^{-1}=1_{A(C)},\\qquad\n\\epsilon_C^{-1}\\circ\\epsilon_C=1_{y(C)\\otimes_{\\mathcal C}A}.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"A(u\\circ v)(a)=A(u)(A(v)(a))","display":false},{"tex":"[D,u,b]=[C,1_C,A(u)(b)]","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"T_A\\circ y","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1852,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-54","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-representable-tensor|Theorem — Representable Tensor Identity]]"},{"id":"af8af33cef1d96d9","anchor":"ref-99","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-representable-tensor]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-256","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-representable-tensor]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-178","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-representable-tensor]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-55","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-thm-representable-tensor|Theorem — Representable Tensor Identity]]"},{"id":"1895c20f7dacd11c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["decc9a8183e886fb","9be0fca5551bd9d2","99b72d10a7d872f5","1bdaf4a293143165"]}